<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 68.8970 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 68.8970 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 68.8970 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 68.7710 on Monday.</p>
<p>					  Sep 17		  Sep 16</p>
<p> tenge per dollar		   68.8970		 68.7710</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  2.695		   0.515</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
